@* Layout for pages that must never be able to render inside the authenticated
   app shell (MainLayout) — currently just /login. MainLayout's shell used to
   be reachable any time a visitor held a still-valid token (Back button right
   after logging in, or typing /login directly) because Login.razor had no
   @layout of its own and fell back to MainLayout's [Authorized] branch, which
   rendered the full sidebar/app bar/logout button *around* the login form.
   Giving /login a dedicated layout with no AuthorizeView at all makes that
   structurally impossible instead of relying on auth state updating in time. *@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<AppProviders />

<div class="auth-shell">
    @Body
</div>
